                        <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS9602Turaev">Turaev
                     </persName> doesn't propose any dating for the manuscript.</note>
                    </origin>
                    <provenance>The original owner was
                       <persName role="owner" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS12709WaldaKahen">Walda Kāhǝn</persName>.
                      The manuscript was bought in Ethiopia by the Russian diplomat
                       <persName role="owner" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS7674Orlov">Alexander Orlov</persName>.</provenance>
                      <acquisition>The manuscript was acquired by the Asiatic
                        Museum on <date>10 September 1903</date>.
                    </acquisition>
               </history>

